<title>USA: Meris facing &quot;severe financial challenges&quot;.</title>
<headline>Meris facing &quot;severe financial challenges&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, California 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meris Laboratories Inc said late on Monday it faced &quot;severe financial challenges&quot; and would meet its creditors to discuss debt repayment alternatives so as to avoid the need for a formal insolvency proceeding.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that the meeting would be held on February 14 in San Jose.</p>
<p>The company was delisted from Nasdaq in January but continues to be traded on the over-the-counter bulletin board.</p>
<p>Meris shares closed at 1/4 on Monday.</p>
</text>
